# Marketplace 
- Our goal is to build a marketplace for live visuals (web apps) for VJs
  - The website brings together visual producers and VJs 
    - Producers perspective
      - create visuals by uploading them
        - add tags
        - set price per hour (20-80 split)
        - visuals are web apps
        - upload folder (soundcloud style: disk space limit)
          - pay for more storage
        - we host that folder
      - earn when VJs use your artworks
    - VJs create a profile
      - filter by 
        - tags
      - exploring is free (preview for free)
      - pay per usage while performing 
        - charge per second, show price per hour
    - Visuals are being previewed as pictures, previewed on hover in iframes. Clicks send random values to all faders. 

- Some aspects are already implemented. 
- Some new parts have to be implemented. 
- What's already there: 
  - A WJ (web jockey) Mixer that opens a new tab where different web apps are loaded into iframes that can be blended together
    - Both, the mixer as well as the page that contains the iframes are implemented by this web app
  - A Gallery that shows av-controllable artworks
  - The AV Controller itself which sends control signals to an artwork in a separate tab
  - A mode

